"evidence_ids":[],"id":"step.cover_condition","kind":"claim","label":"Divisor majorants and the cover condition (V)","locator":"Theorem 3.1, condition (V), p. 6","source_id":"paper.short.pdf","statement":"For each $j\\ge1$, $F_j\\subseteq\\mathbb{N}_{>0}$ is finite, $0<\\alpha_j\\le1$, and $c_{j,d}\\ge0$ satisfy $f_{F_j}(n)^{\\alpha_j}\\le\\sum_{d\\mid n}c_{j,d}$ $(n\\ge1)$. With $C_j=\\sum_{d\\ge1}c_{j,d}/d$, condition (V) is $\\sum_{j\\ge1}\\frac{C_j2^{j\\alpha_j}}{2^{\\alpha_j}-1}<\\infty$.","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/step.cover_condition","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/short.thm-variable-fractional-cover","id":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/edges/%5B%22short.thm-variable-fractional-cover%22%2C%22step.cover_condition%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/edges/%5B%22short.thm-variable-fractional-cover%22%2C%22step.cover_condition%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","semantic_class":"curated_argument_support","to":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/step.cover_condition"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/step.common_distribution","id":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/edges/%5B%22step.common_distribution%22%2C%22step.cover_condition%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/edges/%5B%22step.common_distribution%22%2C%22step.cover_condition%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","semantic_class":"curated_argument_support","to":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/step.cover_condition"